sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Manage the user account
    %% Stories: 7, 15, 18, 21, 28, 38
    %% Description: A user creates an account, links an email account, saves favorite donation centers, and looks up rewards and the transaction history. An admin can block a spamming user.
    actor UP as User (person)
    actor AD as Admin
    participant U as User
    participant RW as Reward
    participant AC as Activity

    %% covers 15
    UP->>U: create account
    %% covers 38
    UP->>U: link email for password recovery
    %% covers 7
    UP->>U: add favorite donation centers
    %% covers 28
    UP->>U: receive rewards
    U->>RW: rewards
    %% covers 18
    UP->>U: check transaction history
    U->>AC: past activities
    %% covers 21
    AD->>U: block spamming user
